{ pivotcols~requires~one~selector~for~each~non-empty~row }
{ This~system~has~#1~non-empty~row(s),~but~pivotcols~contains~#2~selector(s). }
\msg_new:nnnn { linesys } { invalid-pivot-selector }
{ invalid~pivotcols~selector~'#1'~for~row~#2 }
{ Use~a~variable-column~number,~rhs,~or~none. }
